From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] gtk4: expand the Journal shell child when shown

The Journal is registered in the shell stack as a rooted child. GTK4 can leave
that child visible but with no allocated content after a direct semantic
ShowJournal call. Explicitly request expansion and visibility after selecting
the child so its toolbar and list receive the shell allocation.

--- a/src/jarabe/view/service.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/view/service.py
@@ -108,6 +108,9 @@
         model.set_zoom_level(model.ZOOM_ACTIVITY)
         model.stack.set_visible_child_name("journal")
+        journal.set_hexpand(True)
+        journal.set_vexpand(True)
+        journal.set_visible(True)
         return True
